1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
[Wind rises over the Pamir Highway and Panj River at sunrise.]

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Ellie slips on gravel; Radiance, ECE, and Alia form a four-woman rescue chain.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Alia gives Ellie a brief cheek peck; Radiance watches with a jealous glance.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
A second gust hits, and the quartet shield and steady one another.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
They reconcile shoulder-to-shoulder as the camera cranes back over the Wakhan Corridor.
